# Unit III — Data Processing Tools: Hive

## Part A: Create the updated table

CREATE TABLE user_data (
    data_date STRING,
    user_id STRING,
    age INT,
    state STRING,
    gender STRING
)
ROW FORMAT DELIMITED
FIELDS TERMINATED BY ','
STORED AS TEXTFILE;

